<section class="page-header">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Documentation</div>
    <h1>System Protocol</h1>
    <p>The technical foundation behind Pulse's community health intelligence engine.</p>
</section>

<div class="dashboard-grid" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Data Sources</div>
        <div class="stat-value text-cyan">6</div>
        <div class="stat-delta">API endpoints</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Health Signals</div>
        <div class="stat-value">6</div>
        <div class="stat-delta">Weighted metrics</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Communities</div>
        <div class="stat-value" id="protocol-communities">--</div>
        <div class="stat-delta">Tracked</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Avg Health</div>
        <div class="stat-value text-healthy" id="protocol-health">--</div>
        <div class="stat-delta">Score</div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    fetch('/api/stats')
        .then(res => res.json())
        .then(res => {
            if (res.status === 'success' && res.data) {
                document.getElementById('protocol-communities').textContent = res.data.communitiesTracked || 0;
                document.getElementById('protocol-health').textContent = res.data.avgHealthScore || 0;
            }
        });
</script>

<section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">How It Works</h3>
    <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <h3 class="step-title">Data Collection</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Pulse connects directly to the Zero Authority API to fetch real-time contributor activity, bounty data, and reputation scores. No mock data. Ever.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <h3 class="step-title">Health Computation</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Six weighted signals combine into a 0-100 score: Activity Velocity (30%), Completion Rate (25%), Retention (20%), Reputation Growth (15%), Diversity (10%).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <h3 class="step-title">AI Synthesis</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Llama 3.3 70B via Groq processes raw metrics into plain-language insights: burnout warnings, skill gaps, momentum signals.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

